### Create a security log
POST http://localhost:8080/api/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timestamp": "2026-08-17T20:00:00",
  "username": "admin",
  "eventType": "LOGIN_FAILED",
  "sourceIp": "192.168.1.50",
  "severity": "WARNING",
  "message": "Failed login attempt"
}

### Get all logs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/logs

### Delete logs
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/logs/1

### Update log
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/logs/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timestamp": "2026-08-22T10:30:00",
  "username": "admin",
  "eventType": "LOGIN_SUCCESS",
  "sourceIp": "192.168.1.50",
  "severity": "INFO",
  "message": "Successful login"
}

### Test validation
POST http://localhost:8080/api/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "eventType": "",
  "sourceIp": "",
  "severity": "",
  "message": ""
